## Contract

- Seed observable/internal state once at each rollout start.
- Advance predicted state recursively; never re-seed from intermediate Unreal state/context.
- Use recorded future actions as the open-loop interventions being evaluated.
- Use variable recorded timesteps and the first finalized endpoint at/after each request.
- Record actual endpoint duration.
- Completed-step parameters remain explicitly retrospective and are not claimed MPC-available.

